c payouts (50–1000 USDT) to drive clicks and wallet connection, which is commonly used for phishing/drainer scams. (Patterns: crypto airdrop scam, wallet connection phishing/drainer risk, urgent/limited-time pressure (first 5,000, act now), get-rich-quick / free money claim, suspicious external link, gamified reward (spin/roulette) to induce wallet connect)", "Abstained": false, "CheckName": 10, "ProcessingTimeMs": 0}, {"Score": 4.95, "Details": "AI: Spam - This is a classic crypto airdrop/phishing-style solicitation: it urges urgency (“only first 5,000”), instructs users to connect a wallet and interact with a gambling-like “roulette,” promises large random USDT payouts, includes a direct promotional link, and uses a personal testimonial (“I got 150 USDT”) to persuade others to act quickly and use multiple wallets. It is not relevant to survivalism/common sense discussion and matches spam indicators for misleading sensational claims and promotional content.", "Abstained": false, "CheckName": 6, "ProcessingTimeMs": 0}]}', 0, -100026957614982, 9.9, 14.85);
