ickbait hooks, Urgency/exclusivity language)", "Abstained": false, "CheckName": 10, "ProcessingTimeMs": 0}, {"Score": 4.85, "Details": "AI: Spam - The message is sensationalist fearmongering (“THE WORLD IS BEING PREPARED FOR THE END!”, secret bioweapon, reptilians) and primarily promotes an external Telegram channel via a t.me invite link. It provides no substantive survival/preparedness discussion and matches common bot-like conspiracy/promo patterns. The same conspiracy-forward format appears in prior history, reinforcing that it’s unsolicited promotional spam.", "Abstained": false, "CheckName": 6, "ProcessingTimeMs": 0}]}', 0, -100026957614982, 4.85, 9.35);
