her than provide verifiable info. (Patterns: sensational/urgent bait (\"BANNED\", \"wild\", dramatic claim), health misinformation-style miracle claim, teaser content withholding (\"THE TEST NAME & FULL PROTOCOL\"), call-to-action to external content, Telegram invite/referral link (canonical-spam.test/+...))", "Abstained": false, "CheckName": 10, "ProcessingTimeMs": 0}, {"Score": 4.8, "Details": "AI: Spam - The message uses classic clickbait/medical-scare marketing language (\"BANNED in the US\", \"trick\", \"could save your life\"), vague promises of a \"specific blood test\" and \"full protocol\" without naming it, and funnels readers to an uncontextualized t.me (Telegram) invite link. This matches spam indicators: sensationalist health claims + link redirection to a promotional channel, with no legitimate discussion context.", "Abstained": false, "CheckName": 6, "ProcessingTimeMs": 0}]}', 0, -100026957614982, 4.8, 9.2);
